{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24026","headline":"咏兴五首 四月池水满 · 白居易","name":"咏兴五首 四月池水满","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四月池水满，龟游鱼跃出。\n吾亦爱吾池，池边开一室。\n人鱼虽异族，其乐归於一。\n且与尔爲徒，逍遥同过日。\n尔无羡沧海，蒲藻可委质。\n吾亦忘青云，衡茅足容膝。\n况吾与尔辈，本非蛟龙匹。\n假如云雨来，祗是池中物。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}